 "remarks": "Just when you thought all the good summer rentals were gone! Charming New England Colonial literally steps to everything downtown Westport has to offer yet offering your own private oasis. This is truly in-town living at it's best with Westport beaches just a short drive away. Enjoy walking to town for your morning coffee or smoothie. Lunch in the shade on the porch of one of the historic restaurants and when day starts turning into night, head out on foot once again with dozens of elevated global cuisine diner options such as Nomade and The Cottage. Some of Fairfield's best shopping can also be found here while you stroll along the scenic Saugatuck river! This home delivers all your summer dreams and you will feel completely relaxed the moment you step inside. 1 month minimum stays with longer visits welcome. Inquire for other dates & rates along with additional details.",
